sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant API as FastAPI
    participant Notes as Notes Module
    participant Search as Search Module
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Cache as Redis

    %% Create Note
    C->>API: POST /api/v1/notes
    API->>Notes: create_note(data)
    Notes->>Notes: Validate input (Pydantic)
    Notes->>Notes: Process markdown → HTML
    Notes->>Notes: Calculate word count
    Notes->>DB: INSERT note
    DB-->>Notes: Note created
    Notes->>Search: index_note(note)
    Search->>DB: UPDATE search vector
    Notes->>Cache: Invalidate note list cache
    Notes-->>API: Note object
    API-->>C: 201 Created + note

    %% Update Note
    C->>API: PUT /api/v1/notes/{id}
    API->>Notes: update_note(id, data)
    Notes->>DB: SELECT note by id
    DB-->>Notes: Note record
    Notes->>Notes: Process markdown → HTML
    Notes->>DB: UPDATE note
    DB-->>Notes: Note updated
    Notes->>Search: reindex_note(note)
    Notes->>Cache: Invalidate caches
    Notes-->>API: Updated note
    API-->>C: 200 OK + note

    %% Search Notes
    C->>API: GET /api/v1/search?q=query
    API->>Cache: Check search cache
    alt Cache hit
        Cache-->>API: Cached results
    else Cache miss
        API->>Search: search_notes(query)
        Search->>DB: SELECT with tsvector query
        DB-->>Search: Search results
        Search->>Cache: Cache results (2 min TTL)
        Search-->>API: Results
    end
    API-->>C: 200 OK + results

    %% List Notes (with pagination)
    C->>API: GET /api/v1/notes?page=1
    API->>Cache: Check list cache
    alt Cache hit
        Cache-->>API: Cached list
    else Cache miss
        API->>Notes: list_notes(page)
        Notes->>DB: SELECT with pagination
        DB-->>Notes: Paginated results
        Notes->>Cache: Cache list (5 min TTL)
        Notes-->>API: Results
    end
    API-->>C: 200 OK + paginated notes
